    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902560/extras/ad196473e68590f314d95118863b500d.avif?t=1723219699\" width=500 height=200 /></span><br><br>Postlife is an <i>exploration-based RPG</i> where you traverse a mysterious mansion in search of your missing sister.<br><br>Experience a strange micro society inside the walls of the Afterafter life! <i>A mystifying existence between life and death!</i><br><br>The strange inhabitants of this mansion seem to be obsessed with getting high through whatever means necessary, surely Wade will keep sober! <i>Right?</i><br><br>Will Wade find her missing sister? <i>Or will she be trapped in purgatory forever!?</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902560/extras/1d8fabe3c113f0dd34ad84c89d8387a3.avif?t=1723219699\" width=500 height=200 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Hand drawn Character Sprites!</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Special Character Dialogue for being Sober or High!</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Special rooms that change entirely if you are High!</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Multiple Endings!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902560/extras/d2752912fb3915773c29210efb74a7c9.avif?t=1723219699\" width=500 height=200 /></span><br><br>All this stress can be overwhelming! Why not take a load off explore with a mellow mind?<br><br>Explore the entire Afterafter life while you're High! Wade has unique responses to any and everything while she's wasted!<br><br>Change the outcome of your journey with one simple hit!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902560/extras/df5c77cc71976a031c67df5f062a9505.avif?t=1723219699\" wi